From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 28/29] fix(libc): resolve archived app0 odx files exactly first

Keep /app0 paths relative to the archive root. Report an accidentally
wrapped app0/ directory instead of silently accepting the wrong layout.

Retry only a missing terminal .odx name as .odxb in AppArchiveLookup,
using ZArchive-compatible ASCII case folding and accepting regular files
only. Preserve exact archive entries, native overrides and directory
names; do not change generic resolver refusal or conversion flags.

Exercise root-relative param.sfx, exact-first binary asset selection,
selected sizes and bytes, native shadows, unchanged unrelated paths,
normal listings and checked damaged-block reads with real writer fixtures.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
